WEBVTT

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:03.170
Lower your head!

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.020
You there, prostrate yourself and capisce!

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:08.570
I'm so sorry!

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:09.620
Uh...

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:12.950
What?

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:49.710
I'm so sorry!

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:51.370
N–No way...

00:01:51.370 --> 00:01:52.970
Are you Chiri?

00:01:52.970 --> 00:01:53.860
Yes...

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:56.100
I see your game!

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:59.890
You want me to let my guard down, then strike while my back's turned!

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:01.430
You won't trick me that easily!

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:03.850
No, that's not it!

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:06.890
It's just that when I enter PriPara,

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:09.600
for some reason I start acting like that...

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:10.400
What?

00:02:10.970 --> 00:02:12.000
Um...

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.280
in PriPara, I was speaking so high-handedly to you.

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:17.690
I'm so truly sorry!

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:20.370
Please, if you could find it in your heart to forgive me!

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:23.480
At least allow me to offer a token of my apology.

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:24.410
One of you...

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:25.000
Milady.

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:27.210
A pure-gold bear carving.

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:28.770
A pure-gold akabeko toy.

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:30.340
Pure-gold yatsuhashi confectionery.

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:31.150
What?

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:33.290
I–I don't really need any of these things.

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:35.760
I beg your forgiveness...

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:39.130
<i>So this is Chiri outside of PriPara...</i>

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:40.720
<i>It's way beyond what I expected!</i>

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:46.430
<i>I received a vision of our new perfect team-ucha!</i>

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:48.010
<i>First is Chiri...</i>

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:51.280
<i>A team with Chiri?</i>

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:56.340
Hey, what do you think about performing together, to see what it's like?

00:02:56.770 --> 00:02:57.850
No way!

00:02:57.850 --> 00:03:00.570
Oh, I'd be so intimidated...

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:02.780
So humble – I love it!

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:04.350
Come on, let's go!

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:06.130
Oh, but I have no confidence at all...

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:07.580
You'll be fine!

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:15.800
Let's go on and enter–

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:17.550
Uncivil one!

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:20.470
Prostrate yourself and capisce!

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:22.170
Capisce!

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:22.930
Wait.

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:24.430
What's going on?

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:28.180
Just a moment ago, you were <i>apologising</i>:
"I was speaking so high-handedly; I'm so sorry!"

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:31.010
<i>I</i> was apologising?

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:34.040
Won't you learn where you and I stand, commoner idol?

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:35.980
Excuse me? Ugh, I've had it up to here with you!

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:38.180
And I was ready to perform with you–

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:42.430
You're an eternity too early to stand on the same stage as I.

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:43.700
You should be ashamed.

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:45.870
And once more, prostrate yourself and capisce!

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:48.270
Truly, truly, truly...

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:50.580
I've been so terrible rude to you again...

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:54.080
Oh, I'm such a fool! A fool, I say!

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:58.340
Oh, I give up. I don't get this at all.

00:03:58.720 --> 00:03:59.640
Okay...

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:03.180
Good day to you.

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:06.580
Chiri.

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:09.300
Yes?

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:11.730
You understand, don't you?

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:14.060
Your duty is to become a Divine Idol.

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:17.180
Please refrain from associating with such bit player idols.

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:19.650
Okay... I understand...

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:25.620
Her personality's totally different inside PriPara and out...

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:27.260
is she a Mirei-san type?

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:31.120
But Mirei-san acts a character; she's doing it deliberately.

00:04:31.650 --> 00:04:33.100
Ugh, it's impossible!

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:37.010
There's no way I could form a team with that stuck-up Chiri!

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:42.460
I'm exhausted after dealing with Chiri and Pepper all day...

00:04:43.790 --> 00:04:45.590
Go on in!

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:51.040
You'll be living in this room from now on.

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:54.560
We'll put your lifestyle and education back on track,

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:57.500
and restore you to a proper human's way of living...

00:04:58.220 --> 00:04:59.230
What are you doing?

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:03.840
Know this smell!

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:06.640
Smell of one who beat king in Sapanna!

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:10.460
First time me ever see someone so strong.

00:05:11.260 --> 00:05:13.610
Want to meet her! Where is she?

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:16.270
You mean Midorikaze Fuwari?

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:20.850
Midorikaze-san returned to PriParis just this morning.

00:05:20.850 --> 00:05:22.270
Not here?

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:23.690
Shame.

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:27.930
Midorikaze-san is training every day to become a Divine Idol.

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:31.890
I'm sure you'll see her at the next Divine Idol Grand Prix.

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:34.540
Divine Idol Grand Prix?

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:39.530
Almost nighttime.

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:40.620
Time for sleep.

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:41.570
So early!

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:44.920
Well, there's nothing wrong with being early to bed, early to rise.

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:46.380
However!

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:48.370
When you sleep, it must be in a <i>bed</i>.

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:50.780
Not the floor, or...

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:54.850
Th–This is something new entirely...

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:56.360
Why on top of the dresser?

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:59.320
Always slept in trees in Sapanna.

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:07.230
Good morning, everyone!

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:12.560
Please allow me to introduce our new transfer student
from the Sapanna, Taiyou Pepper-san!

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:16.370
Pepper-san hasn't had a proper schooling thus far,

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:21.020
so for now she's been admitted as a first year in the primary school section.

00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:25.230
Do be kind and helpful to our new transfer student.

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:27.950
Wow, so she's joining as a first year?

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:32.660
Will she cope, coming from the Sapanna to a school environment?

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:36.860
Now, then, Pepper-san, if you'd like to introduce yourself.

00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:38.370
Me Pepper!

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:42.100
Brought this as sign of friendship. Eat it!

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:45.300
<i>No</i>!

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:47.230
Where did you find this?

00:06:47.230 --> 00:06:48.580
Whole bunch over there.

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:51.510
You are not allowed to capture the school's animals!

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:53.040
What, you had first?

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:55.470
And you mustn't address a teacher so casually!

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:01.810
I'm suddenly not so sure about this whole endeavour.

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:03.500
What do you think, Rina-chan?

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:05.650
That good to eat?

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:10.360
How ridiculous.

00:07:11.420 --> 00:07:15.870
Now, I wonder how Pepper-san's getting on with her lessons.

00:07:17.840 --> 00:07:19.790
Th–This sound...

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:25.170
Me teach you all rain dance!

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:29.230
Ooh-ooh! Ooh-ah-ah!

00:07:29.230 --> 00:07:35.200
Ooh-ooh! Ooh-ah-ah!

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:37.810
<i>No</i>!

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:39.630
My word...

00:07:39.630 --> 00:07:42.680
I see she'll have to be instructed from the ground up!

00:07:42.680 --> 00:07:45.720
The Head Disciplinarian can whip her into shape...

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:48.690
No, perhaps there's a better way.

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:53.910
Animal Caretaker Manaka Non-san.

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:57.870
I'm charging you with the care of Pepper-san.

00:07:58.140 --> 00:07:59.090
What?

00:07:59.090 --> 00:08:02.330
Be sure to instruct her well in leading a proper school life.

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:07.040
<i>Right when I need to focus on important matters like forming a team...</i>

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:12.010
Pepper-san, make sure you listen to what Manaka-san says, okay?

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:12.690
Refuse.

00:08:12.690 --> 00:08:13.000
What?

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:15.150
Not listen to her!

00:08:15.150 --> 00:08:16.260
What, why?

00:08:16.690 --> 00:08:18.010
You weak.

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:20.470
Me only listen to strong people.

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:21.860
Excuse me?

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:25.140
I'm in <i>charge</i> of you, understand?

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:26.740
Be quiet, rabbit!

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:27.700
Eat you!

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:32.610
You must not eat your friends!

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:34.920
Hey, that's it!

00:08:35.900 --> 00:08:37.340
Principal Ookanda.

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:38.300
Yes?

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:40.160
I have something to ask you.

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:41.860
Whisper, whisper, whisper...

00:08:41.860 --> 00:08:43.540
Hm... hm...

00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:49.460
Hey! You can't sleep out here!

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:51.470
Time for afternoon nap.

00:08:51.470 --> 00:08:53.090
Sleep here.

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:55.540
If you don't listen to me, you'll get <i>this</i>.

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:56.180
Huh?

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:58.090
See? See?

00:09:01.210 --> 00:09:05.220
Okay! Me listen to what you say!

00:09:05.220 --> 00:09:06.100
All right!

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:15.140
Caught it!

00:09:15.140 --> 00:09:16.660
This food all mine!

00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:20.350
Hey! No spearing soccer balls!

00:09:20.350 --> 00:09:21.910
But me brought it down.

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:22.940
Belong to me.

00:09:22.940 --> 00:09:24.700
If you don't listen to me... see?

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:28.200
Me stop!

00:09:31.650 --> 00:09:33.330
No walking on all fours.

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:35.250
And your shoes go on your feet.

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:36.930
But this faster.

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:40.110
Purr, purr...

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:42.100
Hey, it's Non.

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:46.320
So they really did put her in charge of Pepper.

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:49.580
I'm surprised Pepper's listening to her properly.

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:52.170
She is the Animal Caretaker, after all.

00:09:55.250 --> 00:10:00.400
Apparently they're getting all students in the school sixth period for a special lesson.

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:02.240
A special lesson? Wonder what it is.

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:04.180
How intriguing!

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:05.450
Let us go forth and learn.

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:09.810
<i>I totally don't have time for this...</i>

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:13.890
Assembled students!

00:10:13.890 --> 00:10:16.760
Long time no Cézanne! And what a Turnerout!

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:20.280
It's time for the long-Claude Monet-ted, Édouard Manet-ted!

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:23.160
A joint special lesson for music, art and social studies,

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:24.100
in other words...

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:28.060
a Cultural History class on PriPara is being held-Da Vinci!

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:30.520
PriPara Cultural History?

00:10:30.780 --> 00:10:34.980
That's awesome! I'd study PriPara every day if I could!

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:36.420
And without further ado...

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:38.110
Let's Gauguin!

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:40.910
In the following narration,

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:46.040
as usual, please find Ajimi-sensei's sentence enders moderated to a reasonable degree.

00:10:47.530 --> 00:10:52.990
As the sun dawned on human civilisation, so too did PriPara soon follow-Da Vinci.

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:56.640
PriPara, a place where girls can sparkle,

00:10:57.150 --> 00:11:01.160
a place where we can all be friends, we can all be idols.

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:08.170
In every age across the world,
PriPara has given girls hopes and dreams-Da Vinci.

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:11.850
Wondrous performances, brilliant idols,

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:14.520
and at last, in PriPara...

00:11:15.330 --> 00:11:19.490
shall give birth to that legendary existence, a Divine Idol-Da Vinci!!

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:20.820
Ooh!

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:22.270
Ooh-ooh!

00:11:22.270 --> 00:11:23.700
Hey, stop that!
Ooh-ooh!

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:24.670
Ooh-ooh!

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:35.170
At the crux of each era's history,
Divine Idols born from a Divine Idol Grand Prix

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:40.250
have seized the hearts and minds of people in unparalleled performances,

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:44.050
showcasing girls' cuteness around the globe-Da Vinci.

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:47.560
And at long last, such a Divine Idol will this year

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:51.860
be able to come forth in this very Parajuku-Da Vinci!

00:11:52.180 --> 00:11:55.540
Just who will be the next Divine Idol?

00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:59.780
Oh, you just can't tear your eyes away from the Divine Idol Grand Prix-Da Vinci!

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:02.200
It's gonna be us, you know it!

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:05.490
We shall become Infernal Idols surpassing Divine Idols!

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:07.160
Divine Idols...

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:08.950
That's our future!

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:16.020
Mama! Mama!

00:12:16.430 --> 00:12:19.080
Jululu, you have to keep quiet!

00:12:21.020 --> 00:12:22.380
What?

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:23.810
She's standing up!

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:28.530
<i>Divine Idols...</i>

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:30.680
<i>I've got to form a team, and soon...</i>

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:34.430
Come on, how much longer are you going to keep following me?

00:12:34.430 --> 00:12:36.780
You look after me.

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:39.400
That's over when school finishes!

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:41.760
Going to PriPara?

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:43.250
Want to go too!

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:45.840
Be my guest.

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:51.150
Good afternoon.

00:12:51.150 --> 00:12:52.490
Welcome!

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:55.000
Say, you're...

00:12:58.190 --> 00:12:59.870
I knew it!

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:03.860
That irresistible wildness that recalls boundless nature...

00:13:04.810 --> 00:13:10.650
You're the first idol who befits the natural brand Sunny Zoo!

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:12.730
Huh?
What?

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:28.120
This good! Like lion!

00:13:28.340 --> 00:13:30.060
Me love this!

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:31.130
Ooh!

00:13:31.130 --> 00:13:32.220
Jealous?

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:34.450
I'm not jealous!

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:47.330
She's really standing up!

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:48.480
Standing to attention!

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:49.800
Wonderful!

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:52.340
I guess Lala wasn't daydreaming after all!

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:54.990
Yep! Just like I told you, right?

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:58.560
She's growing up day by day!

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:01.290
Babies really do grow quickly, don't they?

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:04.720
I bet she'll be walking by herself soon.

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:06.450
I'm looking forward to it...

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:09.320
Then we can all go walking together!

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:10.520
Right, Jululu?

00:14:10.520 --> 00:14:11.660
Huh?

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:13.310
Huh? Jululu?

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:14.590
She disappeared?

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:16.520
What... but why?

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:19.320
She was right here...

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:22.080
Hello..

00:14:22.480 --> 00:14:24.570
Lala! Where are you now-kuma?

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:28.450
Now? We were just about to head to PriPara,

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:30.340
but Jululu suddenly vanished...

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:32.880
Jululu vanished? Then it's as I ursa-mised!

00:14:41.140 --> 00:14:44.020
Jewlie's walking around in front of us-kuma!

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:46.320
What? Jewlie is?

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:15.440
What? Is that Jewlie?

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:17.180
Isn't that the goddess Jewlie?

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:20.490
What a lovely coord you're wearing!

00:15:20.490 --> 00:15:22.830
Wha–? Oh, um, thank you.

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:24.430
See you later!

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:27.060
The goddess Jewlie?

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:28.510
Don't be silly!

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:30.450
There's no way she'd be walking around here...

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:33.980
This light...

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:35.240
Chiri! Chiri!

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:36.120
Yes...

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.970
Chiri! You must go to PriPara immediately!

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:40.080
What?

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:42.050
But I don't want to...

00:15:42.050 --> 00:15:43.290
The time is at hand...

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:44.570
Hurry!

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:46.650
O–Okay!

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:48.650
Jewlie...

00:15:48.650 --> 00:15:49.780
It's Jewlie...

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:51.520
Good day.

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:53.500
I'd like to register for a performance.

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:55.390
Certainly. May I have your name?

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:57.170
It's Jewlie.

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:00.560
Non!

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:03.270
Non! Th–There's big news-ucha!

00:16:03.470 --> 00:16:04.860
Hey, dinner!

00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:08.140
You can't eat her!

00:16:08.720 --> 00:16:09.860
Did something happen?

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:11.320
Yes! Big news-ucha!

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:12.140
PriPara-ding-dong!
Jewlie...

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:13.320
PriPara-ding-dong!

00:16:13.960 --> 00:16:17.420
The goddess Jewlie will be performing momentarily.

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:19.240
You won't want to miss this!

00:16:19.570 --> 00:16:21.530
PriPara-dong-ding...

00:16:21.530 --> 00:16:23.220
Jewlie's performing?

00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:24.160
No way!

